{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Arcana Academy",
    "steam_appid": 3612250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcana Academy is a magic-themed card simulation management game, with many mysteries waiting to be discovered. In the game, you will play as a mage headmaster and freely construct your magical academy, summon and train vampire or other race students, providing support for the empire's reconstruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/6189572486174f8db4aace84770d4439.avif?t=1755606239\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you could freely construct and develop your magical academy, would you choose to teach students or nurture monsters?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely construct your magical academy, from regular classrooms to mage towers,\u00a0from craft workshops to automated production. Step by step, upgrade facilities and buildings, optimize production lines, and increase production efficiency.\u00a0Cultivate different races, unleash their potential, but also be wary of those with poor self-control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/9947b0922e874797ffd84c9291264fbd.poster.avif?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/9947b0922e874797ffd84c9291264fbd.webm?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/9947b0922e874797ffd84c9291264fbd.mp4?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/2da78954592fb5d7245f2918b786bc1f.avif?t=1755606239\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The mysterious summoning ritual for students, what results will the ritual lead to if demon blood is mixed in?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add your favorite materials to the ritual, with offerings that can be souls, animals, or coins. The correct execution of the ritual usually requires fixed offerings, and the results are generally consistent; however, if you play against the rules, the results might lead to the unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/e5a9b1c0b2e2b993d1f03b190202a2b3.poster.avif?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/e5a9b1c0b2e2b993d1f03b190202a2b3.webm?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/e5a9b1c0b2e2b993d1f03b190202a2b3.mp4?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/82214220a3294bc2185b6040ae2f1d52.avif?t=1755606239\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your various Academies, from names to teaching philosophies, whether to develop comprehensively or specialize in one area?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each academy's name and emblem can be freely defined. Add students to the Academy, formulate suitable study plans for them, help them comprehend the mysteries of elements, or study more effective production methods. Ultimately becoming a genius... or falling into mediocrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/0160b7cee971fe04992c2b3c4d434d42.poster.avif?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/0160b7cee971fe04992c2b3c4d434d42.webm?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/0160b7cee971fe04992c2b3c4d434d42.mp4?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/EN-4.png?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When faced with powerful enemy invasions, will you choose to fight together or offer some sacrifices to temporarily ease the crisis?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your school-building process, monsters will constantly covet you. To ensure peace and stability for your Academy, besides sending people to resolve them, you can also offer some protection fees in exchange for more development opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/f2188709c0eaddbaca9a8f94da7c2bc1.poster.avif?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/f2188709c0eaddbaca9a8f94da7c2bc1.webm?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/f2188709c0eaddbaca9a8f94da7c2bc1.mp4?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/d2979107877b46531998bf219b1e8105.avif?t=1755606239\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The continuously unlocking new magic and technology, will it help you create legends or trigger more disasters and crises?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process of expanding the Academy, you will encounter many new knowledge and magic, mastering more technology and fully automated production to rapidly develop your Academy. But continuous development is a double-edged sword, potentially bringing more crises along with it, so be sure to prepare for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.poster.avif?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.webm?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.mp4?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcana Academy is a magic-themed card simulation management game, with many mysteries waiting to be discovered. In the game, you will play as a mage headmaster and freely construct your magical academy, summon and train vampire or other race students, providing support for the empire's reconstruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/6189572486174f8db4aace84770d4439.avif?t=1755606239\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you could freely construct and develop your magical academy, would you choose to teach students or nurture monsters?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely construct your magical academy, from regular classrooms to mage towers,\u00a0from craft workshops to automated production. Step by step, upgrade facilities and buildings, optimize production lines, and increase production efficiency.\u00a0Cultivate different races, unleash their potential, but also be wary of those with poor self-control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/9947b0922e874797ffd84c9291264fbd.poster.avif?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/9947b0922e874797ffd84c9291264fbd.webm?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/9947b0922e874797ffd84c9291264fbd.mp4?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras