g_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/d2979107877b46531998bf219b1e8105.avif?t=1755606239\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The continuously unlocking new magic and technology, will it help you create legends or trigger more disasters and crises?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process of expanding the Academy, you will encounter many new knowledge and magic, mastering more technology and fully automated production to rapidly develop your Academy. But continuous development is a double-edged sword, potentially bringing more crises along with it, so be sure to prepare for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.poster.avif?t=1755606239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.webm?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.mp4?t=1755606239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Build your magic academy in this card realm, Recruit students, manage their tasks or classes, perform rituals, and explore a perilous magical world. Faced with the encroachment of the Abyss, can you live up to people's expectations and save the empire from crisis?",
